Welcome to the '''{{SITENAME}}'''! A collaborative community reference for ''Human Host'', the open-world zombie survival crafting game by [https://store.steampowered.com/app/2393970/Human_Host/ Virtual Matrix Studio]. Everything you see is destructible. Everything you build can be programmed. Every night, the horde comes.

This wiki is an online encyclopedia which [[w:Help:Editing|anyone can edit]] and contribute to, [[Special:CreatePage|creating a new page]] or [[Special:AllPages|improving an existing one]]. If you're new and don't know where to start, feel free to reach out to one of our [[Special:ListUsers/sysop|administrators]] or check out [[w:Help:Getting Started|these Fandom help pages]]!

