==Progression at a glance==
Progression is biome-driven: each biome gates new resources, and each resource tier unlocks a workbench that produces the tools to survive the next biome.

# '''[[Mossy Forest]]''': starting biome. Wood, Stone, [[Campfire]], [[HandMade]] crafting.
# '''[[Mountain Forest]]''' / '''[[Winter Forest]]''': Iron, [[Furnace]], [[Anvil Workbench]], first metal weapons.
# '''[[Tropical Jungle]]''' / '''[[Tropical Swamp]]''': organic reagents, [[Biochemical Workbench]], [[Cutting Workbench]].
# '''[[Desert]]''' / '''[[Desert Rocky]]''': advanced ores, [[Mechanical Workbench]], vehicle upgrades.
# '''[[Winter Town]]''' / '''[[Wasteland]]''': mid-late loot, [[Electronics Workbench]], [[Gun Workbench]].
# '''[[Warzone]]''': endgame threat tier.

