==About the game==
'''Human Host''' is an open-world survival crafting game with unusually deep systems:

* '''Genre:''' Open-world survival, base-building, tower defense
* '''Developer:''' Virtual Matrix Studio
* '''Released:''' 2026-04-05 (Early Access)
* '''Engine:''' Unity 2022.3 (Mono, with BepInEx pre-installed)

Distinctive features include destructible everything (terrain, buildings, trees), horde-night tower defense, [[Lua Programming|Lua-programmable vehicles]] that can be turned into autonomous defenders, and a save-to-disk world that persists your tunnels and bases across sessions.

